   121	Exact schema: W:python/owl/kaggriculture/types.py:109–138,174. `banks[e,s,:]` is self/rival; transition banks are absolute seats 0/1. Terminal-step masks/clock/banks describe the new game. Fully overwrite padding. Actor frame ordinal = actor_slot = kernel actor index (farmer, then hands); W:python/owl/model/kaggriculture.py:573; G:ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/1.2.md:585.
