   536	1. Acquire every typed borrow; validate all destinations and inputs, exact shape/C/writeability, checked byte products and pairwise disjointness. Validate raw action slices in env/seat order: signed lengths and slot ranges/padding before narrowing. Preflight staging/destination E equality. No writes.
