   572	Short-circuit disabled components and cap multiplication safely to avoid `0*inf` NaNs at huge counts/coefficients. Reject remaining nonfinite output. Production formula is Rust; C8 `rewards.py` ports typed config and an independent pure-Python oracle/tests, never computes live env reward or falls back on native failure. Reference math: R:python/owl/kaggriculture/rewards.py:19,74; reward tests live in R:tests/kaggriculture/test_env.py:168–210 (no standalone reference test_rewards.py). Deliberately remove unsupported modes/share_weight/default coefficients.
