   574	Match R:engine_rs/src/training.rs:403–419 rounding: compute f64 penalty delta, cast economic difference to f32, then on terminal promote that f32 to f64, add terminal term, cast to f32. Python oracle models these rounding points independently. Full untruncated gamma1 episode telescopes: opponent cumulative penalty minus own plus terminal scale*sign, absolute return<=1 in real arithmetic. Test f64 telescoping and f32 sum within the explicit sum of output-rounding ULP budgets, not a loose arbitrary tolerance. Bootstrap-augmented partial returns/GAE are not bounded by this proof. Owner W=.2 is Task 3.4 recipe input (W:ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/plan.md:259), not a hidden default or optimality claim.
