   131	| 1 | hour (within day) | / `turns_per_day` |
   132	| 2 | day | / (`episode_steps` / `turns_per_day`) |
   133	| 3 | remaining transitions = `max(0, max(1, episode_steps − 1) − step)` | / `episode_steps` |
   134	| 4 | `turns_per_day` | / 24 |
   135	| 5 | `max_market_orders_per_turn` | / 10 |
   136	| 6 | `shed_capacity` | / 1,000 |
   137	| 7 | `farm_hand_cost_mult` | / 100 |
   138	| 8 | `episode_steps` | / 1,000 |
   139	| 9 | `weed_spawn_chance` | as is |
   140	| 10 | `town_shop_unlock_interval` | / `turns_per_day` |
   141	| 11 | `town_shop_sell_interval` | / `turns_per_day` |
   142	| 12 | `town_center_sell_interval` | / `turns_per_day` |
   143	| 13 | `starting_money` | / 200,000 |
   144	| 14 | unlocked shop count | / 8 |
