   752	## Risks and Claude review questions
   753	
   754	Risks are bounded by tests above, not silently assumed resolved:
   755	
   756	- **L4:** root feature unification is deliberate. Tests must execute with those features active; disabling arbitrary precision to make Orbit pass would corrupt the engine contract.
   757	- **L6:** exact categories/counts are admitted before indexing; shape products cannot wrap; downstream model indexes must not be inferred from rounded floats or clamped to accept invalid data. A CPU field test says nothing about compiled GPU GEMM offsets, BF16, or learner equivalence.
