   577	- **Fixture custody / circular oracle:** dense states are synthetic; codec supports optional layouts; source patches could accidentally alter decoder behavior. Preserve original blobs and appended harness/patch hashes, exact seeds, source tags, both decoder outcomes and independent rerun. Hash checks prove identity, not truth; decoder + JSON + real-kernel checks provide separate evidence.
